@startuml requirements_member_c
top to bottom direction
title Figure 7C  User Requirement Diagram — Statutory Obligations\n[Individual task · Member C]\n(SysML requirement notation expressed in PlantUML; source: spec 3.0-3.2, 12.4)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam legend {
  FontSize 19
  BackgroundColor #F7F7F2
  BorderColor #9A9A8C
}
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor<<requirement>> #FDF3E7
  BorderColor<<requirement>> #C07A2C
  ArrowColor #9A9A9A
}
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F7F7F2
skinparam noteBorderColor #9A9A8C
hide circle

' ================= Top-level requirement =================
class "Audit Support System" as SYS <<requirement>> #EDE7F6 {
  id = "REQ-00"
  text = "Enable a single RCA to complete\na statutory audit engagement"
}

' ================= Containers =================
class "Mandatory requirements" as MREQ <<requirement>> #F6E3C8 {
  id = "REQ-M"
  text = "Capabilities the system must provide\n(spec 3.1)"
}
class "Optional requirements" as OREQ <<requirement>> #D8E6F5 {
  id = "REQ-O"
  text = "Features deferred or configurable\n(spec 3.2)"
}

' ================= Mandatory (Member C) =================
class "M-03" as M03 <<requirement>> {
  id = "M-03"
  text = "Statutory decision points need explicit\nhuman confirmation to proceed"
}
class "M-09" as M09 <<requirement>> {
  id = "M-09"
  text = "Verify ASIC registration and ABN\nat engagement acceptance"
}
class "M-12" as M12 <<requirement>> {
  id = "M-12"
  text = "Clock statutory notification deadlines;\npending ones block signature"
}
class "M-13" as M13 <<requirement>> {
  id = "M-13"
  text = "All pre-signature statutory preconditions\nmust pass before RPT-01"
}
class "M-14" as M14 <<requirement>> {
  id = "M-14"
  text = "Withdrawal at any phase; workpapers\nsealed on exit"
}

' ================= Optional (Member C) =================
class "O-05" as O05 <<requirement>> #E8F1FA {
  id = "O-05"
  text = "Reuse the client profile across\nsuccessive audit years"
}

' ================= Containment =================
SYS +-- MREQ
SYS +-- OREQ

MREQ +-- M03
MREQ +-- M09
MREQ +-- M12
MREQ +-- M13
MREQ +-- M14

OREQ +-- O05

' ================= Derive =================
M03 <.[#7B4FA0,thickness=2,norank]. M13 : <<deriveReqt>>
M13 .[#7B4FA0,thickness=2,norank].> M12 : <<deriveReqt>>\n(no pending report)

' ================= Informal description and acceptance criteria (12.4) =================
note right of SYS
  <b>Informal description</b>
  As the RCA, I need the system to check the
  client's ASIC registration and ABN before I
  accept the engagement, and to stop at every
  statutory decision point until I confirm it. It
  should time the statutory notification deadlines
  and stop me from signing while a notification is
  pending or any other pre-signature condition is
  unmet. I must be able to withdraw at any phase,
  with the workpapers sealed when I do. Later, I
  would like to reuse the client profile in the
  next audit year.
end note

note bottom of M09
  Raised from O-02 to mandatory because
  P0 depends on it (3.1): change history,
  not a derivation.
  ----
  O-02: Figure 7A (Member A).
end note

note bottom of M12
  Acceptance: dueAt computed from awareDate and
  not editable; escalated 3 days before due and
  again when overdue; blocks RPT-01 while pending.
end note

' ================= Layout =================
MREQ -[hidden]right- OREQ

M09 -[hidden]right- M03
M03 -[hidden]right- M13
M13 -[hidden]right- M12
M12 -[hidden]right- M14

M14 -[hidden]right- O05

legend bottom
  Notation
  ====
  Box <<requirement>> = one requirement, carrying its id and text.
  Crosshair line (+--) = SysML containment; the crosshair sits on the container.
  Dashed arrow <<deriveReqt>> = the derived requirement points at its source.
  Beige = mandatory (spec 3.1); blue = optional (spec 3.2).
  Notes give the acceptance criteria from the traceability matrix (12.4).
  ----
  Other requirements: Figure 7A (Member A), Figure 7B (Member B); full set in Figure 7.
end legend
@enduml
